---
import Layout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Layout title="Defense Workshop Replay · On Demand | Thee Rainers">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="description" content="90 minutes on demand. Defensive structure from the base up. Footwork, stance, live Q&A. Watch when you're ready. $47." />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- HERO — dark, full-bleed, CTA above the fold on mobile -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0A0A0A]">
    <img src="/images/workshop_bacgkround.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true"
      width="1920" height="1080"
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-15 pointer-events-none select-none"
      loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />

    <div class="relative z-10 px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pt-28 md:pt-44 pb-14 md:pb-20">
      <div class="max-w-[680px]">
        <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">On Demand · Full Recording</p>
        <h1 class="font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] mb-6"
          style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 4.75rem);">
          The Defense<br/>Workshop.<br/>Recorded.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-white/55 text-base leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-[460px]">
          The framework for not getting hit. Footwork, stance, defensive structure, live Q&A. 90 minutes on your schedule.
        </p>

        <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/6oUaEX7hp6Xk3LIdww6J20p"
          class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center rounded-none bg-[var(--blue)] text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-85 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--blue)] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#0A0A0A]">
          Get the Replay · $47 →
        </a>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-white/25 text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">
          <span>90 Min</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>Instant Access</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>7-Day Link</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span class="text-white/45 font-bold">$47</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF — Giancarlo -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[2fr_3fr] gap-12 md:gap-20 items-center">

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[260px] mx-auto md:mx-0 overflow-hidden border border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
          <div class="relative w-full" style="padding-bottom: 177.78%;">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VCj0Dgfoako"
              title="Giancarlo — 5 months"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mt-4 text-center md:text-left">Giancarlo · 5 Months</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Field Report</p>
        <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tighter text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-[0.9] mb-6">
          "My footwork makes sense. I can see openings instead of just swinging."
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/40 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[400px]">
          Giancarlo started sparring. Five months. What you see in this clip is built on the same mechanics this workshop teaches.
        </p>
        <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/6oUaEX7hp6Xk3LIdww6J20p"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-none bg-[var(--blue)] text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-85 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--blue)] focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
          Get the Replay · $47 →
        </a>
        <p class="text-[9px] text-[#0A0A0A]/25 mt-2"><a href="/legal/refund-policy" class="underline hover:text-[#0A0A0A]/50">Refund Policy</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT'S INSIDE — 3 pillars, problem-framed -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8">
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">What's inside.</p>
      <h2 class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tighter text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-[0.88] mb-10">
        Three things this session fixes.
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="border-t-2 border-[#0A0A0A] pt-5">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Why you keep getting hit.</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">The break is almost always in your stance or positioning. The session maps where your defense fails before pressure even comes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t-2 border-[#0A0A0A] pt-5">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Why your movement fails under pressure.</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Footwork that works in drills breaks in sparring. The workshop finds where the chain disconnects and builds the fix from the base up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t-2 border-[#0A0A0A] pt-5">
          <p class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tight text-sm mb-3">Live Q&A. Real problems. Real answers.</p>
          <p class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fighters in the live session asked the questions you probably have. Every answer is in the recording.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-white px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-12 md:py-20 border-b border-[#0A0A0A]/8" aria-labelledby="replay-faq-heading">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">Questions</p>
      <h2 id="replay-faq-heading" class="font-black text-[#0A0A0A] uppercase tracking-tighter text-3xl leading-tight mb-10">Common Questions</h2>
      <dl class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-[#0A0A0A]/8">

        <div class="py-6">
          <dt class="font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm mb-2">How long is the access window?</dt>
          <dd class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">7 days from the moment you purchase. Your link arrives by email. Watch at your own pace within that window. If you need a specific clip again after the window, email rainers@theerainers.com.</dd>
        </div>

        <div class="py-6">
          <dt class="font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm mb-2">Is this too basic if I have been training for years?</dt>
          <dd class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you can explain exactly where your weight shifts on a jab and why your chain disconnects at round three, this might be too basic. Most fighters with years of training cannot. The workshop finds the break in the chain.</dd>
        </div>

        <div class="py-6">
          <dt class="font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm mb-2">I have shadowboxing skills but they don't transfer in sparring. Will this help?</dt>
          <dd class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">That gap is almost always a stance problem. When pressure comes, the base breaks and everything built on top of it collapses. The workshop addresses that exact failure point.</dd>
        </div>

        <div class="py-6">
          <dt class="font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] text-sm mb-2">Is there a refund if it doesn't help?</dt>
          <dd class="text-[#0A0A0A]/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. Email rainers@theerainers.com within 24 hours of accessing the replay and the refund is processed. See the full <a href="/legal/refund-policy" class="text-[var(--blue)] underline hover:opacity-70">Refund Policy</a>.</dd>
        </div>

      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SCRIPTURE + final CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#0A0A0A] px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-14 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-[780px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-10">
      <div>
        <p class="font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.88] mb-4 text-white/50 text-2xl md:text-3xl max-w-[520px]">
          "I do not run aimlessly. I do not fight like a boxer beating the air."
        </p>
        <p class="text-[var(--ink-soft)] text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">1 Corinthians 9:26</p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/6oUaEX7hp6Xk3LIdww6J20p"
        class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-none bg-[var(--blue)] text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-85 focus:outline-none whitespace-nowrap">
        Get the Replay · $47 →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
